<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8108" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνειμι</span></b> , in 
			Att.
		 serving as fut. to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέρχομαι,</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνῄειν,</span>
		
			Ep.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνήϊον,</span> as
			impf.:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>go up,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμ᾽ ἠελίῳ ἀνιόντι</span> at
				sun-<i>rise,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.136
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3
			</span></i>. <i><span class="en">
				85
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνήϊον ἐς περιωπήν</span>”
				<i>I went up a hill,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.146
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				614d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ δ᾽ ἄνεισ᾽ εἰς αἰθέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					687
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱδρὼς ἀνήει χρωτί</span>
			<i>came up</i> upon the skin, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				767
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>reach, attain to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς προβλήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					531c
				</span></i>
			: Medic., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὰς σ́</span>
			<i>raised the dose</i> to six cotylae, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				5.84
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sail up,</i> i.e. <i>out to sea,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ Τροίης ἀνιόντα θοῇ σὺν νηΐ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.332
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόντον ἀνήϊον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.238
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>go up inland</i> (v. supr. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>), esp. <i>go up</i> into Central Asia, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ὰγγελίη ἀνήιε παρὰ τὸν βασιλέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.108
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ Πειραιῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					439e
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἄστυ Φαληρόθεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					172a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>come forth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				11.33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>to be promoted,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς Ἄρειον πάγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hyp.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					138
				</span></i>
			, Lexap.<i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνιόντα καὶ κατιόντα πρόσωπα</span>
			<i>ascendants</i> and descendants, <i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				117.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				118
			</span></i>
			<u>Pr.</u>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>approach,</i> esp. as a suppliant, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνεισι πάϊς ἐς πατρὸς ἑταίρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.492
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				499
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>go back, return,</i> freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ Αἰθιόπων ἀνιών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.282
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐπὶ τὸν πρότερον λόγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.140
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				7.239
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλάσσης ἐς τέκνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.Com.
					173.11
				</span></i>
			; without Prep., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάλιν δὲ τῶνδ᾽ ἄνειμί σοι γένος</span>”
				<i>genus repetam,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Heracl.</u>
					209
				</span></i>
			.</div>
